YkGj4Oz0e57Id7eG9w&oe=6998427E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KYzOn2L48-0Q7kNvwHmnDle&_nc_oc=Admd3Jam1Mq3WaAu3soeJNBogyNZMXq3Sit2hU5rIUfToUZzIjBwWhEs3I2V_Pq4vKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvVfNQUx5Do1E-0kvXkdMDj6WYKADBAIncoT2rPPmXHTQ&oe=6998537C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2rIpIw8u_5IQ7kNvwG_5hZo&_nc_oc=Adk3mK52KVWlBGLePybGqK86L5BcKh0mJHTbbbwryfC3_2ArE4U94E0MP49Rw_W-HLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvcdRv8ZKtxpR0aUDg4_zCftxozWRNeiIUmQeKJjqGCoA&oe=69987207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9xpxjnyFTnMQ7kNvwFYuUmb&_nc_oc=Admlp8CLQ8eOWht9rJuew2KVhoQlk1eeC57k-bMJL354MfedofFjnYlv9BB_V3Mu12o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsnvTBx-fEQUq833Z1VyfAuQpcyW8fm9O5xNM0M_f7I3w&oe=69985DD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ySrqoLXuFb0Q7kNvwHH7abi&_nc_oc=AdlUzw5XZk0ILP75X9MbSYo-7QdT6ExzGPr1PBZmWUAbVGrwOWGl0p3sahN6bIfuLgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfulUsLffGe8tCfr6ErVJBd4dNzHgoWXnVqXdw4NSqHIlQ&oe=69986A64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\nDownload Flipside today!"}]}, "developer_name": "Flipside XR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.flipsidexr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.flipsidexr.com/terms", "publisher_nam